/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-eef0679fda731d34END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1221f0dbc9494639END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_LOW_DeadMansSwitchNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_DeadMansSwitchNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_DeadMansSwitchNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">96bddd6c-f40a-45c4-a552-35e9b7cefa7f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:96bddd6c-f40a-45c4-a552-35e9b7cefa7f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:96bddd6c-f40a-45c4-a552-35e9b7cefa7f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by Black Gauntlet <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tamia_Holzt\" title=\"Tamia Holzt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png/25px-Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png/38px-Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png/50px-Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tamia Holzt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png/25px-Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Portrait_Tamia_Holzt.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tamia_Holzt\" title=\"Tamia Holzt\">Tamia Holzt</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>CAUTION: <a href=\"/wiki/Waldemar_Prinski\" title=\"Waldemar Prinski\">Prinski's</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Motivator\" title=\"Motivator\">Motivator</a> is the supreme <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\">Banite</a> means of ultimate coercion, but it is useful solely as a deterrent and not as a weapon. When triggered, the user has only moments to deactivate it before the prison tank charges detonate and the hostages are killed -  taking with it our leverage over the <a href=\"/wiki/Gondian\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondian\">Gondian</a> artificers. Threaten convincingly, but never go to full detonation unless the entire <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Foundry</a> falls to our enemies!\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>DETAILS: So long as you hold the Motivator, you are safe from the Gondians, for they know that if you are attacked, their loved ones will die. However, to prevent accidental massacre, the Motivator can be deactivated easily with the correct input. Don't worry about the Gondians, they'll be too terrified to grab a dropped Motivator. They are weak and cowardly, the natural prey of the Worshipper of Bane.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202603\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1810/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30307/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10184/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 940222/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.081      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   48.081      1 -total\n 39.38%   18.934      1 Template:PageSeo\n 39.26%   18.875      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 38.11%   18.326      6 Template:Icon_text\n 36.98%   17.782     21 Template:Trim\n 29.14%   14.012      1 Template:RarityItem\n 28.00%   13.465      1 Template:Item_icon\n 21.27%   10.226      2 Template:Uid\n 18.96%    9.116      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12687-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202603 and revision id 394362. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}